      {
        "finding": "Table 4 reports ASAM and FSAM accuracies above standard SAM for WideResNet 28-2 on CIFAR-10; FSAM is also numerically above SAM on CIFAR-100, while ASAM is substantially below it.",
        "proposed_claim": "The tested perturbation geometries yield different held-out accuracies, without establishing a correlation between measured sharpness and generalization gaps.",
        "row_ids": [
          "R17",
